*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : PEN0045
*> PURPOSE : PENALTY ASSESSMENT RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-05-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-10-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 114
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB PENNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PEN0045.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 LATE-CNT-12M       PIC 9(2).
    *> DAYS PAYMENT IS LATE
    05 DAYS-LATE          PIC 9(3).
    05 RUN-DATE           PIC 9(8).
    05 RUN-DATE-R REDEFINES RUN-DATE.
       10 RUN-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 RUN-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 RUN-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(4).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 ACCT-STATUS        PIC X VALUE 'A'.
    05 LATE-CHARGE        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM REPEAT-OFFENDER
    PERFORM 4100-TO-COLLECTIONS
    DISPLAY "ACCT-STATUS=" ACCT-STATUS
    DISPLAY "LATE-CHARGE=" LATE-CHARGE
    STOP RUN.
REPEAT-OFFENDER.
    IF LATE-CNT-12M >= 4 AND DAYS-LATE GREATER THAN 30
        MOVE 'S' TO ACCT-STATUS
        ADD 50 TO LATE-CHARGE
    END-IF.
4100-TO-COLLECTIONS.
    *> COLLECTIONS REFERRAL
    IF DAYS-LATE > 60
        MOVE 'C' TO ACCT-STATUS
    END-IF.
